; The waiting shed: Sophia's investigation on the bench (see WaitingShedSequence). Positions are in the space of this scene's root;
; in the dream the root is at world (65, -12.452, -16). The bench holds, seen from its open front (+Z): the closed backpack on the
; left, the notebook with the clipping in the middle, the hinged box on the right (the tape on the token inside it).
