; The performance of the recording (see ShelterFootage): Emily, built in code and hidden except inside the recording, sits on the bench's left half (MarinaSeat is the point on the seat
; under her pelvis, +Z the way she faces: her left is then +X); the strip of ground the carried camera walks along (WalkStart to WalkEnd along the front of the shelter, in the lamp's light; Walk2Start to Walk2End east of it); the three cameras
; are markers under Shots (ShotRecording: the hidden camera, ShotRecordingC: the aftermath photograph's own viewpoint).
