[node name="WalkEnd" type="Marker3D" parent="Shots"]
position = Vector3(1.5, 0.0, -1.0)

; The first walk is 9 m (12 s at a slow walking pace), east along the front of the shelter; the second is 12 m (16 s), 2 m south of it and walked the other way (west). Both strips were chosen by reading the dream terrain's own tree and bush instances: no
; tree or large bush stands within 1.5 m of either (the first strip I had put the camera 0.4 m from a rock and close to the old tree line).
[node name="Walk2Start" type="Marker3D" parent="Shots"]
position = Vector3(2.0, 0.0, 1.0)

[node name="Walk2End" type="Marker3D" parent="Shots"]
position = Vector3(-10.0, 0.0, 1.0)

; Angle A: the hidden camera, wide and oblique, east-south-east of the shelter and behind ferns, on Emily's left (she turns to her right, away from it); she is a third of the picture's height.
